Vendored upstream: verl
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The `verl/` directory of this repository contains a vendored copy of verl
0.9.0, redistributed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

    verl -- Volcano Engine Reinforcement Learning for LLMs
    https://github.com/volcengine/verl
    Copyright 2024-2025 Bytedance Ltd. and/or its affiliates
    Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0

The vendored tree is NOT pristine. It has been modified to implement on-policy
distillation (OPD): 26 files were added and 20 upstream files were modified,
relative to the upstream 0.9.0 release. The principal additions are the frozen
teacher worker, the token-level reverse-KL advantage estimators, and the
top-K distillation policy loss. Modified upstream files retain their original
ByteDance copyright notices, as required by Apache-2.0 section 4(b)-(c).

Upstream verl itself carries contributions from, among others, Meituan Ltd.,
the PRIME team, the SGLang Team, BAAI, NVIDIA CORPORATION, Huawei Technologies
Co., Ltd., z.ai, the SwissAI Initiative, and individual contributors. Their
copyright notices are retained in the individual source files.

