Datasets
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

No dataset is distributed with this repository. Every benchmark and training
corpus is rebuilt from its public source by the scripts in `data/prep/`, and
each remains subject to the license of its original publisher. The only data
files shipped here are the two small fixtures under `data/smoke/`.
